### 1. GET - Obtener un recurso
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
Accept: application/json

### 2. POST - Crear un nuevo recurso
POST https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prueba de API con WebStorm",
  "body": "Probando el cliente de WebStorm",
  "userId": 1
}

### 3. PUT - Actualizar un recurso existente
PUT https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Título Editado por Alejandro Ojeda",
  "body": "Contenido actualizado exitosamente",
  "userId": 1
}

### 4. DELETE - Eliminar un recurso
DELETE https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1